{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_aprot2_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_aprot2_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "那一場戲",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_aprot2_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e839eddef0c5ccf40c7ebd0c4a621da668a4841c69fb439703309d4e9329d4a9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天空的顏色很古怪。\n太陽暗淡無光，雲朵染著灰色，天幕從遠處開始破碎，裂痕向著中心蔓延。\n但這一切在此時都不再重要。\n你還記得這一天。\n你總是忘不掉這一天。\n這一天好似一個注定會來的預言，早已被所有人知曉。\n這一天又像一個無法擺脫的噩夢，從無一刻停止糾纏。\n你已經分不清這是否是一場戲。\n你的生活，或許從來只是他人眼中的一場戲。\n沉淵。\n你問你自己。\n台上的演員只有劇本，可是你呢？\n你要怎麼選擇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我還是做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "沉淵，你不該心軟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "如果不是我搞砸了我們的計劃，其他人也不會死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "現在你還有將功贖罪的機會，帶我的腦袋回去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "閉嘴！別讓我後悔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我不該心軟……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……那我該如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我應該現在就殺了你，割下你的頭，帶回領主面前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "然後忍辱負重，等待復仇時機……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "不，這不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……拿著這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "這是，你的匕首……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "給你，你走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "可是，沉淵！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "放走了我，你要怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你又一次做出了選擇。\n你已經很清楚自己要怎麼做了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的村人",
      "text": "小伙子，多謝你這幾天幫著照顧孩子們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的村人",
      "text": "幾個小崽子都說你講故事講得好聽咧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "不用謝，老伯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "孩子們都很聽話，反而是我們借住在這裡，給各位添麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的村人",
      "text": "不麻煩不麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的村人",
      "text": "哎，那我就不耽擱你們幹活了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "給小孩講故事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "看來你和村裡人相處得挺不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "動動嘴而已，也不費什麼功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "那也是你有這個耐心，我就不太行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "這幾天過得太平靜了，任務也沒出什麼意外，我都不太習慣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "平靜一點也很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我倒是希望不要出任何意外……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "你的理想是隱居嘛。我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "對了，沉淵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "我這有件禮物要給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "禮物？是什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "球形的重物被丟在你的面前。\n微微腐爛的東西落在地上，發出沉悶的聲響。\n“禮物”在地上滾動，最終停在你的腳邊。\n那雙渾濁無光的眼珠與你對視。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "我把這傢伙的武器也一起帶回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "這原本是你的，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "為……什麼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "被你一時心軟放走的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "在你以為自己已經逃離過去的時候，忽然以這種形式出現……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "沉淵，你當時不殺掉他是正確的選擇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "正確的，選擇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "這讓這齣戲更精彩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "怎麼，沉淵，這不正是你為劇團完成的劇本嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "劇本……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "不，不是的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我已經和劇團沒關係了，我早就逃出來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "這不是劇本！這怎麼會是劇本？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "不……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "這是我自己的選擇……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "什麼選擇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "沉淵，你在說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……這是……我自己的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我沒能動手殺了你，這是正確的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "不，不對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "雖然不知道你在煩惱什麼，但殺了我，才是最好的辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "你不用擔太大風險，只要按照安排行事——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "不！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "沒有什麼安排，你不該死在這個時候！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "快走！我和你一起！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我們都能逃出去，這次只要小心一點……只要躲起來，不被抓到……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "沉淵，你冷靜一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "我跑不掉的。最後還能見到你，已經夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "你要做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "住手！停下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "我不能拖累你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……騙人的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不再說話的男性",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "別演了，起來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "快起來！再不走就來不及了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不再說話的男性",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……你為什麼不說話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "沉淵，我們已經沒有別的路可走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "殺了我，把我的腦袋帶回去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "你聽到了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "快殺了我！我們沒有太多時間了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "殺了你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "像這樣，把匕首送入你的心臟，然後看你一點點死去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "對，沒錯，就是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悲傷的男性",
      "text": "沉淵，你的選擇是正確的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "可是……這真的是我的選擇嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "哈……哈哈……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "你會死，我知道你會死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "你的頭顱注定會離開脖頸，我只希望它不必落在灰塵裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "所以這一次，這一次我會親手割下你的頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "這是你的預言嗎，沉淵？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我不會預言，這是我看到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我看到你死了。就算我放走你，你還是會死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我也逃了，但我終究還是逃不過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "你當然逃不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "沉淵，就算你藏得再好，也躲不過那些看著你的眼睛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……是誰在看著我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "當然是觀眾們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "觀眾……觀眾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我演砸了，他們只會想要除掉我，為什麼還要看著我？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "確實，有人為你在舞台上表現出的心軟而感到憤怒，但這也是意料之中的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "你我都知道，這正是藝術的魅力所在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "好的戲劇，好的演員，理應能夠影響他人的情緒，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "不……不是這樣，不應該是這樣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "放過你是我自己的選擇，不是他們的安排！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "如果你真的能肯定……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "為什麼你還一直走不出這場噩夢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "為什麼你明明已經逃離，卻還會反覆重現那一天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "為什麼你要嘗試各種可能，要將我從那副身軀上割下，帶在身邊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "我……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "沉淵，你在恐懼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "放過我，是你唯一一次反抗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "從劇團的手下逃走，花光了你僅有的勇氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "“血鑽”已經找上門來，你卻只能躲藏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "一直以來，比起害怕他們追上來，你更害怕這一切都是被操縱的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "你不喜歡別人的目光落在你身上，因為你在擔憂，這裡根本就不存在一個“真實的自己”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "頭顱",
      "text": "我說對了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "閉上你的嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "你只是我夢中的惡靈，你根本不存在於此！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉淵",
      "text": "不要叫我沉淵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不要叫我那個名字！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的頭顱",
      "text": "哈哈，可憐的人，你殺不死你的恐懼，你無法讓那些疑慮閉嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的頭顱",
      "text": "你知道的，尋找自我是一種禁忌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的頭顱",
      "text": "但它能成就偉大的藝術！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的頭顱",
      "text": "你仍然在為藝術奉獻！他們都錯誤地評價了你，你是一個傑出的演員！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "閉嘴！我不是在演戲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我會擺脫你，我會殺死你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我不會再回任何被安排好的舞台，我早就不是沉淵了，我的一切不是一場戲劇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的頭顱",
      "text": "哦，你的小小決心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的頭顱",
      "text": "那麼，我問你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "破碎的頭顱",
      "text": "你不是沉淵，你是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我，是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "……落？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "暮落？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "我……我在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "抱歉，我有點走神了……出什麼事了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "你發什麼呆呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "沒什麼事，就是我剛剛好像聽到你和人說話……結果過來一看，你就站在這發呆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "……你聽錯了，這裡只有我一個人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暮落",
      "text": "沒有其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "嗯？那可能是我耳朵出問題了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "對了，■■。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "■■",
      "text": "……你喊我什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "啊？■■啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "怎麼了，這不是你的代號嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "哎，不說那些，你看——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
      "text": "我這有件禮物要給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "■■",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "■■",
      "text": "禮物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
